From 69cf902344907a15ee656b03d7c1c3b34a7224c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hc-push dev <dev@localhost>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:08:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: AppRequest::RequestGossipRound

Let an app ask its conductor to start the next gossip round in one of its
DNAs with a given peer, instead of waiting for Kitsune2's own target
selection. The peer must already be a live agent in the conductor's peer
store (e.g. added through AddAgentInfo, which verifies its signature).

Requires Kitsune2's Gossip::request_round.
