+    /// Ask this conductor to start its next gossip round for `dna_hash` with
+    /// the peer at `url`, instead of waiting for its gossip schedule to pick
+    /// a peer.
+    ///
+    /// `url` must belong to a live agent in this conductor's peer store, for
+    /// example one added with [`AppRequest::AddAgentInfo`]; agent infos are
+    /// signature-verified when added, so an unverified peer cannot be
+    /// requested. The peer still applies its own rate limits, and ordinary
+    /// peer selection resumes afterwards. Useful for a node that was offline
+    /// and knows which always-on peer holds the data it is missing.
+    ///
+    /// `dna_hash` must be the DNA of a cell of this app.
+    ///
+    /// # Returns
+    ///
+    /// [`AppResponse::Ok`]
+    RequestGossipRound {
+        /// The DNA (DHT space) to gossip in.
+        dna_hash: DnaHash,
+        /// The peer's URL, as found in its agent info.
+        url: Url,
+    },
